== http_serve
split head and body:
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 19

POST /up body=hello
--
split chunked:
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 15

POST /c body=hi
--
closed early:
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Content-Length: 0


--
HEAD:
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: text/plain
Content-Length: 13


--
304:
HTTP/1.1 304 Not Modified
Content-Type: text/plain


--
